        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: JJ Project, Got7\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom\n- Companies: JYP Entertainment\n- Concepts: South Korean pop duo, South Korean boy group\n\nFacts:\n- JJ Project is a South Korean pop duo consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JJ Project was formed by JYP Entertainment and released its first single \"Bounce\" in May 2012.\n- Got7 is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\n- Got7 is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP \"Got It?\".\n- Got7's first EP \"Got It?\" peaked at number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.",
